{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"9217548191f08d10f69d9ed203a40c88fe873491db496a25bf9be6b0cc14097d","ja":"ファンサービスのポーズ","zh":"粉丝服务的姿势","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"248265cfc376b7860931eddd671e9808de1b70c6ea8b0c2ac0d39dd28644ac3e","ja":"ふぉぉ～っ！　美奈子ちゃんのすべてを包み込む笑顔、\nエミリーちゃんの奥ゆかしいお辞儀……最高です～！","zh":"哇啊～！美奈子包容一切的笑容，\n艾米莉端庄文雅的鞠躬……都太棒了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"018d6a54526d2571a6359c34e9063cd5be517eaf6dee19070d3dc94789b61b99","ja":"亜利沙、次は私たちの番だよ！\nカメラはしまってね。","zh":"亚利沙，接下来轮到我们了哦！\n把相机收起来吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5729d48fd9a3280d0c6a1cb7fc9944ba17bb98217f2e31fa2c4fa006737d79c4","ja":"ファンサービスのポーズか～。それじゃあ……\nくるくるくる～♪　どう？","zh":"给粉丝送福利的姿势啊～。那就……\n转呀转呀转～♪　怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"7ac554b28a3c2f0a571815b838cc830a2698e31945d4b56a3e4315226438aeb7","ja":"バレエのポーズですね？　エレガントです～！\nええと、それじゃあ、ありさは……。","zh":"是芭蕾的姿势对吧？好优雅哦～！\n那个，那么，亚利沙就……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"41f2d1a9fbe2d9cb5b4e86b59cb2c1ec71242bd9482401385c6f88edf2e437d8","ja":"熱いコール＆レスポンスで！\nみなさーん！　いかがでしょうか～！","zh":"用热情的呼应互动！\n大家——！觉得怎么样呀～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"579248c541936dffbdc5f3b0c233d41614a73888eca89d39b16aff59f55f78ac","ja":"ふふ、楽しそうで素敵だね！\nそれじゃあ私は……えいっ！　ええと、伝わるかな？","zh":"呵呵，看起来很开心，真好呢！\n那我这就……嘿！那个，能传达到吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"b220cacda47bda385bb45b2c7bace4828f429d9a3b02c5f45a0061a755ae2af4","ja":"「フェンシングですね！\n判定は……お三方も合格！　それでは撮影開始です！」","zh":"「是击剑呢！\n判定结果是……三位都合格！那么开始拍摄！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"63a82d3d89714d3841e6d7fff78589de91a91913ab3f1e961991c6d31468e098","ja":"みなさん、いっぱい撮ってくださいね～！\nでも、やっぱりありさは客席に……。","zh":"大家要多拍点照片哦～！\n不过，亚利沙果然还是想去观众席……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"c4a643b3e0cdd9b59107f19c5396e573a569cca5168224de5f13b48bf86bc2fb","ja":"あはは、今日はガマンだよ、ありりん。\n撮ってもらうのに集中しよっ！","zh":"啊哈哈，今天可要忍住哦，亚利凛。\n专心让他们拍吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"36ccc83343b2bc35f0b112a8dcea0b86eb2c410939b0f60543840c36f8d4bc2a","ja":"そして、ひとしきり撮影が続いて……","zh":"然后，拍摄持续了一阵子……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7482512b7e80e1b41477f1fb88df35a84fb89b88c4526a63b37a90f5454a4dfe","ja":"みなさんに楽しんでもらえたみたいで、嬉しいです。\nあ、そろそろ次のお題ですか？","zh":"大家看起来玩得很开心，我也很高兴。\n啊，差不多该进行下一题了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"f14150555edbe733c689548d9df221988781af13276ba665fc3877b1803ccdde","ja":"「はい！　次のポーズは……\n『今の気持ちをかわいく表現！』で、お願いします！」","zh":"“好！下一个姿势是……\n麻烦摆出‘可爱地表达当下的心情！’的动作！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"88e06cf8bb4c103d96aa0e9d1bac1a34579672fb081e55184b6c4b3669162e79","ja":"えっ！　かわいいジェスチャー\n……みたいな感じ？","zh":"咦！　可爱的肢体动作\n……像这种感觉？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"326e0a56faa0763dce6d51a47bc12be7b5850589ba5fbdd7126d7fe23850fd65","ja":"自分の今の気持ちを、かわいく表現……。\nうーん、どうしようかな……？","zh":"把我自己现在的所思所想，可爱地表现出来……\n唔——该怎么做好呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"755c467a041d5a2a65e06eb086d55a315dac8ba012c9489f37f4a47003034d29","ja":"「頑張れ～！　みんなならできるよー！」\n「どんなポーズでも、絶対みんなかわいいから～！」","zh":"“加油～！大家的话一定能做到的——！”\n“不管什么姿势，大家绝对都超级可爱啦～！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"402e2a89ce5fb710a92986f268e4786ec007b6015f70c64c056a5412ab1ed124","ja":"あたたかい応援、ありがとうございます～……はっ！\nありさ、いいことを思いつきました！","zh":"谢谢大家的温暖支持～……哈！\n亚利沙想到一个好主意了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1733.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"c6ac8ff92c7b3af33f4b56ea4a58aa3aab548757e5778de0c3f7a572a93604bb","ja":"こういうのはどうでしょう？　ごにょごにょ……。","zh":"这样的怎么样？附耳细语……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
